1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:02,340
(Howard:)This madness has to stop.

2
00:00:03,888 --> 00:00:06,178
(Leonard:)Penny's taking you to the DMV.
I'm going to bed.

3
00:00:06,349 --> 00:00:09,099
- Why Penny?
- Because rock breaks scissors.

4
00:00:09,269 --> 00:00:10,849
(Sheldon:)Good night.

5
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:14,024
- All right. Come on, Sheldon.
- Hold on.

6
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,440
I've one condition.

7
00:00:15,609 --> 00:00:18,449
(Raj:)- What?
- We have to stop at Pottery Barn.

8
00:00:19,195 --> 00:00:20,485
(Penny:)Okay.

9
00:00:20,655 --> 00:00:22,445
And RadioShack.

10
00:00:22,991 --> 00:00:24,071
(Penny:)Fine.

11
00:00:25,118 --> 00:00:27,708
- And the comic-book store.
PENNY: All right.

12
00:00:28,163 --> 00:00:30,203
I wanna go to the comic-book store.

13
00:00:49,809 --> 00:00:51,979
(Raj:)I like comic books.

14
00:00:57,233 --> 00:01:00,073
I still don't see
why I need a driver's license.

